### IntelliJ IDEA ###
### The whole directory: no .idea file is tracked, and IDE state is per-machine.
.idea/

### Per-machine agent permissions (absolute home paths, key filenames). Not .claude/ —
### .claude/commands/ is shared repo tooling and stays commit-eligible.
.claude/settings.local.json
*.iws
*.iml
*.ipr

### Eclipse ###
.apt_generated
.classpath
.factorypath
.project
.settings
.springBeans
.sts4-cache

