/nbproject/private/
/nbbuild/
/dist/
/nbdist/
/.nb-gradle/
build/
!**/src/main/**/build/
!**/src/test/**/build/

### VS Code ###
.vscode/

### Mac OS ###
.DS_Store
### Private working material, including third-party source held under licence. Publishing any
### of it is a separate, unresolved decision. Do not remove this entry.
_doc/

### Former locations of the same material; kept to catch a re-copy. docs/ is committed and
### publishable, so the entry above does not cover these.
docs/repo_usage/
docs/repository/

### Maintainer-local agent rules: names private paths, so it must never be committed.
CLAUDE.local.md

### Inspection and scan exports. A report over this working tree embeds the private corpus — the
### paths *and* source snippets of _doc/ — under an innocent filename that the CI guard, which
### matches tracked paths rather than content, does not catch. This entry is the only thing between
### a scan artifact and a licence breach.
*.sarif
*.sarif.json
